        "coverImage": "../img/gallery-app/gallery-app-login.png",
        "title": "Gallery App",
        "description": "I developed this private gallery application as a personal project for my girlfriend and me to provide a secure and customized space for our shared memories. My goal was to create a self-hosted alternative to mainstream cloud services that allows us to easily upload images and organize them into tailored albums. On the technical side, I built the entire system from the ground up, engineering a custom backend to handle the core logic and data management. To ensure a smooth development experience, I also implemented a full CI/CD pipeline, which automates the deployment process and allows me to roll out new features quickly. While the gallery remains private for data security reasons, the following screenshots offer a glimpse into the interface and the functionality I’ve implemented.",
